  "version": 1,
  "status": "published",
  "description_nl": "2026-10-07: One gift (s.56(2)(x)): from a relative, or on marriage, by will or inheritance, or in contemplation of death - nothing. Otherwise a sum or movable property counts towards the year's total (chip myreturn.gifts); an immovable property is taxed on its own - received free, its stamp-duty value when more than 50,000; bought for less, the shortfall when more than the higher of 50,000 and 10% of the price.",
